    "slides": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "The engine is off, but you stay sitting in the driveway with your hands resting on the steering wheel.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "RUST",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "You just spent three hours steering an adult sibling through another unraveling crisis.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "RUST",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "Stepping inside means returning to yourself, but right now, that space feels strangely empty.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "RUST",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "When being needed becomes your main anchor, quiet time doesn't feel like rest?it feels like stepping into the unknown.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "RUST",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "text": "This ten-minute pause in the driveway doesn't need to be productive. It is allowed to be just for breathing.",
